=== 2026-10-11T16:55:29.185+00:00 What do we know about HER+ cancer type
2026-10-11T16:55:26.248+00:00 CALL search_pubmed {"query": "HER2 positive cancer OR HER+ cancer", "max_results": 5}
2026-10-11T16:55:27.186+00:00 RESPONSE search_pubmed {"query":"HER2 positive cancer OR HER+ cancer","n_results":5,"articles":[{"pmid":"39821040","title":"HER2-Positive Breast Cancer Treatment and Resistance.","journal":"Adv Exp Med Biol","pubdate":"2025","authors":["Veeraraghavan J","De Angelis C","Gutierrez C","Liao FT","Sabotta C","Rimawi MF","Osborne CK","Schiff R"],"doi":"10.1007/978-3-031-70875-6_24"},{"pmid":"39613746","title":"Identification of HER2-positive breast cancer molecular subtypes with potential clinical implications in the ALTTO clinical trial.","journal":"Nat Commun","pubdate":"2024 Nov 29","authors":["Rediti M","Venet D","Joaquin Garcia A","Maetens M","Vincent D","Majjaj S","El-Abed S","Di Cosimo S"],"doi":"10.1038/s41467-024-54621-3"},{"pmid":"38906351","title":"HER-2 positive gastric cancer: Current targeted treatments.","journal":"Int J Biol Macromol","pubdate":"2024 Aug","authors":["Malla RR","Nellipudi HR","Srilatha M","Nagaraju GP"],"doi":"10.1016/j.ijbiomac.2024.133247"},{"pmid":"34969516","title":"Nouvelles stratégies thérapeutiques dans les cancers du sein HER2-surexprimé: New therapeutic strategies in HER2-positive breast cancer.","journal":"Bull Cancer","pubdate":"2021 Dec","authors":["Mery B","Toussaint P","Heudel PE","Dufresne A","Carbonnaux M","Vanacker H","Bachelot T","Trédan O"],"doi":"10.1016/S0007-4551(21)00632-9"},{"pmid":"30069757","title":"Lapatinib.","journal":"Recent Results Cancer Res","pubdate":"2018","authors":["Voigtlaender M","Schneider-Merck T","Trepel M"],"doi":"10.1007/978-3-319-91442-8_2"}]}
ANSWER HER+ cancer typically refers to cancers that are HER2-positive, meaning they have overexpression or amplification of the HER2 gene. Recent literature on this includes:

1. HER2-Positive Breast Cancer Treatment and Resistance, Adv Exp Med Biol, 2025 (PMID: 39821040). This article discusses treatments and resistance mechanisms in HER2-positive breast cancer.

2. Identification of HER2-positive breast cancer molecular subtypes with potential clinical implications in the ALTTO clinical trial, Nat Commun, 2024 (PMID: 39613746). This study identifies molecular subtypes of HER2-positive breast cancer that may have clinical relevance.

3. HER-2 positive gastric cancer: Current targeted treatments, Int J Biol Macromol, 2024 (PMID: 38906351). This paper reviews targeted treatments for HER2-positive gastric cancer.

4. New therapeutic strategies in HER2-positive breast cancer, Bull Cancer, 2021 (PMID: 34969516).

5. Lapatinib, a therapy related to HER2-positive cancers, Recent Results Cancer Res, 2018 (PMID: 30069757).

If you want, I can provide more detailed insights from these papers or look for more specific information.

